# Direct deps for the cluster venv. Installed by scripts/install_venv.sh with --torch-backend cu128;
# the exact resolved set is in requirements.lock.txt. See docs/setup-report.md (install plan).
# [format] (h5py, hdf5plugin) is needed by eval.py's HDF5Dataset; we skip [env] (mujoco, jax,
# atari, ogbench) because PushT/TwoRoom only need pygame, pymunk, shapely, opencv.
stable-worldmodel[train,format]==0.1.1
pygame
pymunk
shapely
opencv-python-headless
pytest
# The HF LeWM weights use transformers-4 ViT parameter names (encoder.encoder.layer.N.attention.
# attention.query); transformers 5 renamed them (encoder.layers.N.attention.q_proj), so a strict
# load fails. swm[train] itself needs >= 4.50.
transformers>=4.50,<5
# With transformers<5 the resolver otherwise falls back to datasets 2.14 (2023), which calls
# pyarrow.PyExtensionType (removed in recent pyarrow) on `import stable_pretraining.backbone`.
datasets>=3
